# λ sweep: LoRA bits of CoT distillation

Teacher pair: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B (λ=0, Long CoT) ↔ Qwen2.5-Math-1.5B-Instruct (λ=1, Short CoT); student: Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct + LoRA (r=16, all linear layers).
Shared problems: 1940 (train 1640, held 300). Base student accuracy: held 0.782, MATH-500 —.

